  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac></math> (L&#39;Hospitals rule)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>a</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></math></p>"
